{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:85e4b3c26dc13486","name":"Stun Damage","source":{"id":"source:reference-85e4b3c26dc13486","title":"Stun Damage","revision":18534,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:16:37Z","sha256":"f069a92ecfaa5ead2e03958359c8a0c334fc59999cb378921e9c18936385fdf4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18534","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Stun%20Damage&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-85e4b3c26dc13486","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Sometimes you'd rather knock an opponent unconscious than kill them. That's why many weapons have Stun settings and why ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Batons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Batons"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Grenades"}," are popular with law enforcement agencies throughout the galaxy. Various melee weapons and blasters have a Stun setting, and switching a weapon to its Stun setting (or resetting it to normal damage) is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". Some Stun weapons, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Grenades"},", only have a Stun setting.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Unless otherwise noted, the Stun setting on a blaster weapon has a maximum range of 6 squares (no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," penalties).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Only creatures can be Stunned. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},", and objects are immune to Stun Damage. When you make a successful attack with a weapon that deals Stun Damage, subtract half of the Stun Damage from the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},". Additional effects may occur as well, depending on the amount of damage dealt:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["If the Stun Damage reduces the target's current ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," to 0, the target moves -5 steps on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," and is knocked ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unconscious"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unconscious"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["If the Stun Damage (before being halved) equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", the target moves -2 steps on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},"."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A creature knocked ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unconscious"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unconscious"}," by Stun Damage does not die if it rolls a Natural 1 on its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," check to regain consciousnesses or if it fails the check by 5 or more points. It simply remains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unconscious"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unconscious"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
